'''Malaka'Jin''' is a [[Horde]] [[camp]] in the [[Stonetalon Mountains]], {{coords|71|94|Stonetalon Mountains}} just south of the [[Grimtotem Post]]. It houses a small community of [[troll]] [[hunter]]s who make a modest income by selling their catches to passing Horde adventurers. 

The trolls at Malaka'Jin are also mounting covert attacks against the [[night elves]] of [[Stonetalon Peak]], lead by the efforts of [[Witch Doctor Jin'Zil]]. Inside this troll camp, night elves are being held by the [[shaman]], [[Jin'Zil]]. He seeks [[ingredient]]s for his [[voodoo]] [[potion]]s. However, there are not enough trolls here to be a great threat to the night elves. [[Brann Bronzebeard]] once picked off a good number of the trolls here before they noticed him. He felt good for protecting the night elves, but since they were not much of a threat, he did not put more effort into killing them.

